Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:22.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,欢迎收看《造物小百科》
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.20,0:00:22.00,Original,,0,0,0,,On how it's made.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:25.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,钢铁，从摩天大楼到桥梁
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.12,0:00:25.76,Original,,0,0,0,,Steel, from skyscrapers to bridges,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,它都是当之无愧的工业脊梁
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.24,Original,,0,0,0,,it can be trusted to be the backbone of industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.64,0:00:31.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,但这种可靠的建材是如何生产的呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.64,0:00:31.28,Original,,0,0,0,,But just how is this reliable building block produced?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:35.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,苹果汁
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.80,0:00:35.44,Original,,0,0,0,,Apple juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:39.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,你以为苹果汁是在苹果离开果园后，才开始手工制作的吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.84,0:00:39.92,Original,,0,0,0,,Thought your apple juice was produced lovingly by hand after the apples leave the orchard?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:41.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,那你就想错了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.56,0:00:41.28,Original,,0,0,0,,Well, think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.36,0:00:48.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,起落架
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.36,0:00:48.16,Original,,0,0,0,,Landing gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:56.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,当承载超过35吨的飞机着陆时，这件关键设备必须能承受巨大的压力
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.72,0:00:56.20,Original,,0,0,0,,When landing over 35,000 kilos of aeroplane, this critical piece of kit must be able to undergo fantastic stresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.22,0:01:00.26,Translation,,0,0,0,,还有化妆品
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.22,0:01:00.26,Original,,0,0,0,,And cosmetics.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:02.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,香水、眼影和口红
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.64,0:01:02.56,Original,,0,0,0,,Perfume, eye shadow, and lipstick,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:05.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,有些产品含有50多种成分
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.04,0:01:05.52,Original,,0,0,0,,with over 50 ingredients going into some products,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:08.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,这个行业必须以最高标准运作
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.00,0:01:08.48,Original,,0,0,0,,this industry needs to work to the highest of standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.08,0:01:14.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,从摩天大楼到桥梁
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.08,0:01:14.96,Original,,0,0,0,,But first, from skyscrapers to bridges,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:20.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,从家用电器到汽车，以及其间的一切，都得益于它的强大
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.28,0:01:20.96,Original,,0,0,0,,from household appliances to cars and everything in between, thanks to its legendary strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:23.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,钢铁可以担当起工业的脊梁
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.96,0:01:23.92,Original,,0,0,0,,steel can be trusted to be the backbone of industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:29.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,但如何将地球上最丰富的资源转变为可靠的建材呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.88,0:01:29.92,Original,,0,0,0,,But how do you turn one of Earth's most abundant resources into a reliable building block?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.64,0:01:37.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,钢铁由铁矿石或废钢制成
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.64,0:01:37.84,Original,,0,0,0,,Steel is made from either iron ore or scrap metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:41.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,在这家工厂里，利用的是废钢
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.56,0:01:41.28,Original,,0,0,0,,In this operation, it's scrap that will be recycled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.92,0:01:45.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,用一台10吨的电磁铁，把压扁的车身
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.92,0:01:45.44,Original,,0,0,0,,Using a 10-ton electromagnet, crushed car bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.68,0:01:49.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,家用电器、罐子等钢制废料都收集起来
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.68,0:01:49.76,Original,,0,0,0,,electrical appliances, cans, and other steel scraps are gathered up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:54.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,这块强力磁铁能吊起5吨金属
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.04,0:01:54.24,Original,,0,0,0,,This powerful magnet is able to lift 5 tons of metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:59.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,其中约80%的废钢将被加工成钢条
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.12,0:01:59.04,Original,,0,0,0,,About 80 percent of this scrap will be transformed into bars of steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:02.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,这些金属随后被倒入料篮
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.64,0:02:02.48,Original,,0,0,0,,This metal is then dumped into a basket,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:04.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,料篮本身重达32吨
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.72,0:02:04.72,Original,,0,0,0,,which alone weighs 32 tons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:14.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,料篮最多可装下惊人的60吨金属，它们将被熔炼成钢水
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.56,0:02:14.72,Original,,0,0,0,,The basket can hold up to a staggering 60 tons of metal, which is going to be turned into molten metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:20.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,熔炉温度可达1650摄氏度
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.24,0:02:20.56,Original,,0,0,0,,This furnace reaches a temperature of 1,650 degrees centigrade,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.20,0:02:23.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,足以熔化几乎所有物质
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.20,0:02:23.60,Original,,0,0,0,,hot enough to liquefy just about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.32,0:02:28.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,熔炉由3根电极和4个天然气燃烧器加热
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.32,0:02:28.48,Original,,0,0,0,,The furnace is heated by 3 electrodes and by 4 natural gas burners.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:33.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,料篮中的金属被倒入熔炉
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.44,0:02:33.76,Original,,0,0,0,,The contents of the basket are dumped into the furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.64,0:02:39.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,废料与熔化的钢水接触
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.64,0:02:39.76,Original,,0,0,0,,The pieces of metal come into contact with liquefied steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.16,0:02:43.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,排烟系统抽走产生的烟雾
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.16,0:02:43.12,Original,,0,0,0,,And an aeration system draws out the smoke that's produced.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:50.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,在如此高温下，60吨金属约需60分钟即可熔化
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.44,0:02:50.32,Original,,0,0,0,,At this intense heat, the 60 tons of metal will melt in around 60 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:56.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,金属熔化时，混合物中的杂质会浮到表面
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.36,0:02:56.48,Original,,0,0,0,,This molten mix is composed of impurities which rise to the surface when the metal becomes liquefied.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.28,0:03:07.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,此时，工人会取钢水样本以确定其化学成分
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.28,0:03:07.92,Original,,0,0,0,,At this stage, a workman draws a sample of steel to determine its chemical makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:12.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,接着，喷枪向钢水吹入氧气
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.72,0:03:12.16,Original,,0,0,0,,Next, a lance blows oxygen into the molten steel,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:14.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,以降低其含碳量
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.32,0:03:14.08,Original,,0,0,0,,which reduces its carbon content,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:17.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,使混合液均匀并加快进程
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.56,0:03:17.20,Original,,0,0,0,,homogenizing the mix and speeding up the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.04,0:03:25.34,Translation,,0,0,0,,钢包被放置在熔炉下方
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.04,0:03:25.34,Original,,0,0,0,,A ladle is positioned beneath the furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.84,0:03:29.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,钢水将从熔炉注入钢包
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.84,0:03:29.36,Original,,0,0,0,,The molten steel will be transferred from the furnace into this ladle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:34.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,钢水轻松流入钢包
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.84,0:03:34.40,Original,,0,0,0,,The molten steel easily pours into the ladle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:54.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,钢包重55吨，可容纳115吨钢水
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.28,0:03:54.72,Original,,0,0,0,,The ladle weighs 55 tons and holds 115 tons of molten steel,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.12,0:03:59.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,一台可吊起180吨的桥式起重机将它吊起
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.12,0:03:59.68,Original,,0,0,0,,and an overhead crane capable of lifting 180 tons hoists its cargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:04.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,为获得合适的钢质，会加入添加剂
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.36,0:04:04.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Additives are introduced in order to obtain the correct steel tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.68,0:04:08.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,电极从熔炉钢包中取出
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.68,0:04:08.24,Original,,0,0,0,,Here, the electrodes are taken out of the furnace ladle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.80,0:04:18.38,Translation,,0,0,0,,工人现在打开分配器的浇注口
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.80,0:04:18.38,Original,,0,0,0,,A workman now opens the pouring nozzles of the distributor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.56,0:04:25.86,Translation,,0,0,0,,钢水流入模具
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.56,0:04:25.86,Original,,0,0,0,,The molten steel runs into molds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.40,0:04:28.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,钢水迅速冷却并开始凝固
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.40,0:04:28.40,Original,,0,0,0,,It quickly cools and begins to harden.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:36.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,钢坯长度在4.5米到10.6米之间
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.88,0:04:36.16,Original,,0,0,0,,Steel billets are produced in lengths varying between 4.5 and 10.6 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.84,0:04:41.66,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后天然气割炬将钢坯切割成所需长度
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.84,0:04:41.66,Original,,0,0,0,,The billets are then cut into the desired length with a natural gas torch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.96,0:04:48.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,用蜡笔在钢坯上标上浇铸识别号
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.96,0:04:48.64,Original,,0,0,0,,A pouring identification number is marked on them with a wax crayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:53.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,接下来还要对钢坯进行轧制
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.96,0:04:53.12,Original,,0,0,0,,The flattening of the billets remains to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.62,0:05:02.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,全面轧制开始
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.62,0:05:02.00,Original,,0,0,0,,The full flattening begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.64,0:05:08.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,钢坯被送入熔炉，在1095摄氏度的温度下重新加热2小时
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.64,0:05:08.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Billets are placed in the furnace to be reheated for 2 hours at 1,095 degrees centigrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:11.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,水流冷却钢坯顶出装置
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.32,0:05:11.76,Original,,0,0,0,,Water jets cool the billet ejector.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.22,0:05:19.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,钢坯被放在轧机上
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.22,0:05:19.20,Original,,0,0,0,,The billets are placed on the flattener,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:21.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,强大的轧辊对其进行压缩
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.52,0:05:21.28,Original,,0,0,0,,where powerful rollers compress them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.16,0:05:25.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,这一工序使钢坯达到所需的形状和尺寸
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.16,0:05:25.36,Original,,0,0,0,,This operation gives the billets the required shape and size.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:28.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,水冷轧辊碾轧钢坯
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.48,0:05:28.24,Original,,0,0,0,,Water-cooled rollers crush the billets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:33.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,部分钢坯从12厘米的厚度压到14毫米
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.12,0:05:33.44,Original,,0,0,0,,Some billets go from a thickness of 12 centimeters down to 14 millimeters
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:37.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,其余的则从15厘米压到19毫米
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.44,0:05:37.68,Original,,0,0,0,,while others reduce from 15 centimeters down to 19 millimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.00,0:05:45.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,在生产的末端，钢条以高达35公里/时的速度前进
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.00,0:05:45.28,Original,,0,0,0,,At the end of the production, bars move along at a speed reaching 35 kilometers per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:49.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,钢条达到所需尺寸后，必须进行冷却
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.00,0:05:49.28,Original,,0,0,0,,Once they've reached their required dimensions, the bars must be cooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:53.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,冷床能让钢条均匀冷却
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.08,0:05:53.36,Original,,0,0,0,,This cooling bed allows the steel bars to cool uniformly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:59.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,这家工厂每年生产约40万吨钢条
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.24,0:05:59.28,Original,,0,0,0,,A total of some 400,000 tons of steel bars are made at this plant each year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.56,0:06:08.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,你以为苹果汁是在苹果离开果园后才开始手工制作的吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.56,0:06:08.96,Original,,0,0,0,,Thought your apple juice was produced lovingly by hand after the apples leave the orchard?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:10.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,那你就想错了
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.36,0:06:10.24,Original,,0,0,0,,Well, think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:12.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,和所有现代食品生产一样
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.72,0:06:12.40,Original,,0,0,0,,Like all modern food production,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:14.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,苹果汁也是工业化生产的
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.56,0:06:14.96,Original,,0,0,0,,apple juice is made on an industrial scale,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.52,0:06:16.62,Translation,,0,0,0,,而且必须如此
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.52,0:06:16.62,Original,,0,0,0,,and it needs to be
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.92,0:06:21.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,因为仅一家工厂每年就要将4万吨苹果加工成果汁
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.92,0:06:21.92,Original,,0,0,0,,as just one factory transforms 40,000 tons of apples into juice every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.16,0:06:30.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,在加拿大魁北克，主要用麦金托什苹果来制作苹果汁
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.16,0:06:30.00,Original,,0,0,0,,In Quebec, Canada, they make apple juice mainly from McIntosh apples.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:26.16,0:06:29.41,Annotation,,0,0,0,,麦金托什：加拿大的苹果品种, 苹果电脑的苹果就是这个品种
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:35.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,90%的果汁生产在10月的收获季完成
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.72,0:06:35.12,Original,,0,0,0,,90 percent of juice production is done at harvest time in October.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.76,0:06:40.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,工艺流程从传送带将苹果运往检验区开始
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.76,0:06:40.00,Original,,0,0,0,,The process starts when a conveyor transports apples to an inspection location.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:44.34,Translation,,0,0,0,,苹果逆着传送带的方向翻滚
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.12,0:06:44.34,Original,,0,0,0,,Apples tumble in the reverse direction of the conveyor belt,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:47.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,这样湿叶等杂物就会粘在传送带上
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.34,0:06:47.44,Original,,0,0,0,,so that the wet leaves and other materials adhere to the belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.24,0:06:55.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,苹果会在储罐中存放数小时
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.24,0:06:55.68,Original,,0,0,0,,The apples are stored in silos for several hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.80,0:07:02.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,为避免苹果在降落过程中被磕伤，阶梯式滑道会减缓它们下落
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.80,0:07:02.08,Original,,0,0,0,,In order that the apples are not too bruised in their descent, they're slowed down in this stepped chute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:05.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在可以开始榨汁了
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.06,0:07:05.04,Original,,0,0,0,,The juice making can now begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:07.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,苹果先被清洗
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.16,0:07:07.28,Original,,0,0,0,,The apples are washed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.76,0:07:10.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,第一道水浴洗去碎石
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.76,0:07:10.00,Original,,0,0,0,,This first water bath eliminates pebbles,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:12.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,因为这里既用采摘的苹果，也用地上的落果
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.32,0:07:12.72,Original,,0,0,0,,as windfall apples are used as well as picked.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:10.32,0:07:14.07,Annotation,,0,0,0,,落果：从树上掉落而非采摘的苹果
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.44,0:07:16.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,一道冷水喷淋完成整个清洗过程
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.44,0:07:16.24,Original,,0,0,0,,A shower of cool water completes the washing process.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.20,0:07:19.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,苹果在这台粉碎机中被切成小块
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.20,0:07:19.92,Original,,0,0,0,,The apples are cut into little pieces in this grinder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.08,0:07:25.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,为制成果浆，会加入酶来分解苹果的细胞结构
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.08,0:07:25.20,Original,,0,0,0,,To produce gratings, enzymes are added which break down the cellular structure of the fruit
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.20,0:07:27.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,从而最大限度地榨取果汁
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.20,0:07:27.36,Original,,0,0,0,,allowing for maximum juice extraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:32.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,接着，果浆被送入浸渍罐
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.12,0:07:32.08,Original,,0,0,0,,Next, the gratings are transferred into maceration reservoirs,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.08,0:07:35.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,在里面静置60到90分钟
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.08,0:07:35.04,Original,,0,0,0,,where they'll stay for 60 to 90 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.80,0:07:38.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后开始榨汁
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.80,0:07:38.08,Original,,0,0,0,,Then the juice is extracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:41.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,果浆被泵入大功率液压机
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.64,0:07:41.44,Original,,0,0,0,,The gratings are pumped into a powerful hydraulic press.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:47.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,在压机内部，过滤袋挡住苹果皮、籽和茎
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.32,0:07:47.84,Original,,0,0,0,,Inside the press, filter sleeves hold back the skins, seeds, and stems of the apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.72,0:07:52.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,质量控制必须严格
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.72,0:07:52.72,Original,,0,0,0,,Quality control has to be strict.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.12,0:07:54.78,Translation,,0,0,0,,在每一道工序都会抽取果汁样本
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.12,0:07:54.78,Original,,0,0,0,,At each stage of the process
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:59.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,确保卫生规范得到严格遵守
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.78,0:07:59.36,Original,,0,0,0,,samples of juice are drawn off to make sure that the hygiene controls are well adhered to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.44,0:08:08.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,果汁经过过滤，最微小的颗粒也会被滤除
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.44,0:08:08.24,Original,,0,0,0,,The juice is filtered so that the smallest of particles are held back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:17.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,果汁通过这些巨大的储罐逐级流动
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.92,0:08:17.68,Original,,0,0,0,,Juice flows from one stage to the other via these immense reservoirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:20.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,下一步是巴氏杀菌
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.24,0:08:20.96,Original,,0,0,0,,The next step is pasteurisation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.12,0:08:29.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,果汁进入换热器，被加热到88摄氏度
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.12,0:08:29.20,Original,,0,0,0,,Juice enters the exchanger and is heated up to 88 degrees centigrade,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.08,0:08:32.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,然后再冷却回50摄氏度
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.08,0:08:32.08,Original,,0,0,0,,then cooled back down to 50 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.44,0:08:35.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,加入酶使果胶水化
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.44,0:08:35.76,Original,,0,0,0,,Enzymes are added to hydrate the pectin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:44.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,这就是超滤过程，带有微孔的滤膜会截留最微小的颗粒
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.68,0:08:44.80,Original,,0,0,0,,This is the ultrafiltration process, where filter membranes with microscopic pores retain the smallest of particles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.24,0:08:48.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,苹果汁现在已被完美过滤
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.24,0:08:48.40,Original,,0,0,0,,The apple juice is now perfectly filtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:54.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,其澄清度、风味、色泽和天然果糖含量都要经过检验
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.04,0:08:54.32,Original,,0,0,0,,Its clarity is verified as well as its flavour, colour and natural fructose content.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.04,0:08:58.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,由于果汁在10月生产
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.04,0:08:58.96,Original,,0,0,0,,Since juice is produced in October,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:01.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,必须保存起来供全年使用
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.20,0:09:01.28,Original,,0,0,0,,it has to be conserved throughout the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:07.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,一部分产品存放在无菌仓库中，等待全年陆续灌装
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.08,0:09:07.44,Original,,0,0,0,,A portion of the production is stored in this sterile warehouse to await being bottled during the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.76,0:09:13.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,每个储罐可容纳11万升过滤后的果汁
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.76,0:09:13.60,Original,,0,0,0,,Each reservoir can hold 110,000 litres of filtered juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:15.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,不添加任何防腐剂
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.24,0:09:15.76,Original,,0,0,0,,No preserving agent is added.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:23.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,接下来，果汁被倒入容器中
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.76,0:09:23.92,Original,,0,0,0,,Next, the juice is poured into containers,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.08,0:09:26.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,以每分钟100个的速度灌装
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.08,0:09:26.08,Original,,0,0,0,,which are filled at a rate of 100 a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.76,0:09:36.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后容器被密封
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.76,0:09:36.08,Original,,0,0,0,,The containers are then hermetically sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.16,0:09:47.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,喷上两道热熔胶来固定侧面的吸管
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.16,0:09:47.36,Original,,0,0,0,,Two little sprays of hot glue are applied. This secures the straws attached to their sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.52,0:09:57.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,另一条自动化生产线负责瓶装果汁
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.52,0:09:57.44,Original,,0,0,0,,Another automated production line bottles the juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:10:00.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,瓶子在传送带上排成一列循环移动
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.92,0:10:00.00,Original,,0,0,0,,They circulate in a row on this conveyor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.88,0:10:09.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,在无菌室里，瓶子用双氧水清洗消毒
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.88,0:10:09.68,Original,,0,0,0,,Bottles are washed and disinfected with hydrogen peroxide in this sterile room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.08,0:10:16.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后用无菌水冲洗，再送往灌装工位
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.08,0:10:16.16,Original,,0,0,0,,Then they're rinsed with sterile water before being carried to the filling location.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:25.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,每分钟有120瓶灌入巴氏杀菌后的苹果汁并封盖
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.64,0:10:25.92,Original,,0,0,0,,Each minute, 120 bottles are filled with pasteurised apple juice and sealed with a cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:39.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,瓶子随后贴上标签，发往发货区
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.88,0:10:39.20,Original,,0,0,0,,Bottles are then labelled and sent to shipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.08,0:10:46.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,这家工厂每年将2万到4万吨苹果加工成果汁
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.08,0:10:46.00,Original,,0,0,0,,This plant transforms between 20,000 and 40,000 tons of apples into juice every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:52.94,Translation,,0,0,0,,《造物小百科》稍后播出
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.04,0:10:52.94,Original,,0,0,0,,Coming up in How It's Made
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:55.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,飞机起落架
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.52,0:10:55.80,Original,,0,0,0,,Aircraft landing gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:10:59.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,这件关键设备必须能承受巨大的压力
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.08,0:10:59.84,Original,,0,0,0,,This critical piece of kit must be able to undergo fantastic stresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.70,0:11:05.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,还有化妆品，有些产品含有50多种成分
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.70,0:11:05.92,Original,,0,0,0,,And cosmetics, with over 50 ingredients going into some products,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:08.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,这个行业必须以最高标准运作
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.16,0:11:08.56,Original,,0,0,0,,this industry needs to work to the highest of standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:15.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,广告之后见
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.80,0:11:15.12,Original,,0,0,0,,See you after the break.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:22.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,欢迎回到《造物小百科》
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.12,0:11:22.56,Original,,0,0,0,,Welcome back to How It's Made.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:24.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,稍后我们将探访化妆品行业
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.20,0:11:24.96,Original,,0,0,0,,Later we look at the cosmetics industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.52,0:11:27.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,这个行业必须以最高标准运作
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.52,0:11:27.92,Original,,0,0,0,,This industry needs to work to the highest of standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.24,0:11:31.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,升上去的终归要落下来
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.24,0:11:31.60,Original,,0,0,0,,But first, what goes up must come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.64,0:11:36.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,飞机的起落架必须能承受巨大的压力
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.64,0:11:36.96,Original,,0,0,0,,The undercarriage of a plane must be able to undergo fantastic stresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.84,0:11:44.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,这一关键的飞机部件是机械加工与尖端技术结合的产物
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.84,0:11:44.40,Original,,0,0,0,,This critical piece of aircraft equipment is the product of expert mechanics combined with sophisticated technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:53.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,这块沉重的钢材是KC-135R同温层加油机的起落架
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.60,0:11:53.12,Original,,0,0,0,,This heavy piece of steel is the undercarriage of a KC-135R Stratotanker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.16,0:11:58.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,起落架由一根中心主轴构成，车轴和机轮都装在它上面
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.16,0:11:58.80,Original,,0,0,0,,Landing gear comprises a central shaft to which an axle and wheels are attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:01.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,他们开始加工主轴
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.00,0:12:01.44,Original,,0,0,0,,They begin machining the shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:05.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台数控车床加工部件的外表面
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.08,0:12:05.36,Original,,0,0,0,,This digital lathe machines the exterior surface of the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:10.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,水和油的喷淋为因摩擦而发热的部件降温
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.56,0:12:10.24,Original,,0,0,0,,Sprays of water and oil cool the part which heats up due to friction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.88,0:12:14.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,接下来对主轴进行穿孔
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.88,0:12:14.16,Original,,0,0,0,,Next the shaft is pierced.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.76,0:12:18.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,钻头将镗出主轴的内孔
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.76,0:12:18.32,Original,,0,0,0,,The drill head will ream out the inside of the shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:22.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,钻头必须对准分毫不差
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.16,0:12:22.00,Original,,0,0,0,,Alignment of the head must be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:35.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,切削产生的切屑会被收集起来，卖给铸造厂回收利用
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.92,0:12:35.12,Original,,0,0,0,,Turnings from the cutting are saved and these will be sold to foundries where they'll be recycled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.04,0:12:47.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,用于在起落架上钻孔的刀具必须极其锋利
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.04,0:12:47.44,Original,,0,0,0,,The cutting tool used to pierce the holes in the landing gear has to be extremely sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:56.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台机床按需要将孔的两侧扩大
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.80,0:12:56.48,Original,,0,0,0,,The hole is enlarged on its sides as required by this machine tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:09.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,部件再次用水和油的混合液冷却
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.28,0:13:09.44,Original,,0,0,0,,The part is again cooled with a mixture of water and oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:15.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,切削完成后，用压缩空气清理孔洞，以便进行目视检查
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.52,0:13:15.60,Original,,0,0,0,,Cutting is completed and the hole is now cleaned out with compressed air, so that they can proceed with a visual inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.92,0:13:23.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,接下来，3个部件由这台机床同时加工，因为将用于航空领域
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.92,0:13:23.68,Original,,0,0,0,,Next, 3 pieces are rough cut at the same time by this machine, because they'll be used in aviation,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.08,0:13:26.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,这些部件必须加工到完美无瑕
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.08,0:13:26.48,Original,,0,0,0,,these pieces have to be machined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:31.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,主轴的加工现已接近完成
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.12,0:13:31.84,Original,,0,0,0,,The machining of the shaft is now almost completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:38.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,去毛刺机打磨加工过的表面
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.36,0:13:38.32,Original,,0,0,0,,This deburring unit polishes the machined surfaces
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:41.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,用压缩空气工具和砂纸片进行抛光
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.48,0:13:41.28,Original,,0,0,0,,with a compressed air tool and sandpaper discs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.08,0:13:44.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在必须检验部件的尺寸
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.08,0:13:44.80,Original,,0,0,0,,And now they have to verify the dimensions of the parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:50.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台数控机床有3个轴，能以极高的精度进行检验
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.20,0:13:50.24,Original,,0,0,0,,This digitally controlled machine has 3 axes and does the verification with extreme precision.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:13:58.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,另一台设备可加工尺寸更大的部件
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.36,0:13:58.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Another unit allows for the machining of parts with greater dimensions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:10.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,这家工厂还翻新二手起落架
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.76,0:14:10.72,Original,,0,0,0,,This facility also reconditions used landing gear,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.96,0:14:13.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,比如这个来自波音707的起落架
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.96,0:14:13.12,Original,,0,0,0,,such as this one from a Boeing 707.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:16.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,他们用喷砂机除去油漆
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.00,0:14:16.48,Original,,0,0,0,,They strip off the paint with a sandblaster to verify
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.48,0:14:18.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,以便精确检验部件的状态
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.48,0:14:18.80,Original,,0,0,0,,the condition of the parts with great precision.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:23.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,然而，仅凭目视检查是不够的
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.28,0:14:23.44,Original,,0,0,0,,However, a visual inspection is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:27.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,裂纹可通过磁粉聚集来检测
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.16,0:14:27.36,Original,,0,0,0,,Cracks can be detected by magnetic particle concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:32.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,使部件磁化后，任何裂纹都会在紫外光下显现出来
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.84,0:14:32.56,Original,,0,0,0,,They magnetize the part, and any cracks will become visible under ultraviolet light.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.08,0:14:43.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,接下来是喷丸工艺，向金属表面喷射钢珠，以提高其抗疲劳性能
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.08,0:14:43.68,Original,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for the shot metal procedure, where they spray steel balls onto the metal's surface to increase its resistance to fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.64,0:14:47.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,在重新喷漆之前，先给部件镀层
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.64,0:14:47.20,Original,,0,0,0,,Before repainting the part, they first plate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:50.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,在镉液中浸泡10分钟
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.76,0:14:50.24,Original,,0,0,0,,The part is immersed for 10 minutes in cadmium,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:53.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,形成一层防腐蚀的保护镀层
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.56,0:14:53.52,Original,,0,0,0,,which forms a protective coating that will resist corrosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:59.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,然后在低浓度铬酸中快速浸洗
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.16,0:14:59.84,Original,,0,0,0,,Then the part is quickly soaked in a weak concentration of chromic acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:08.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,用气流搅动的水洗去铬酸
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.88,0:15:08.64,Original,,0,0,0,,Water, agitated by air jets, cleans away the chromic acid,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.96,0:15:10.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,再用水冲洗一次
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.96,0:15:10.88,Original,,0,0,0,,and the part is rinsed with water once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:19.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后在190摄氏度下烘烤23小时，以去除镀层过程中产生的氢
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.40,0:15:19.76,Original,,0,0,0,,The part is now baked at 190 degrees over 23 hours to remove hydrogen induced during the plating process.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.16,0:15:30.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,接着浸入零下129摄氏度的液氮中，使其尺寸收缩后再装配
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.16,0:15:30.40,Original,,0,0,0,,Then the part is immersed in liquid nitrogen at minus 129 degrees centigrade before it's inserted, in order to reduce its size.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:33.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,用液压千斤顶将套环压装上去
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.28,0:15:33.76,Original,,0,0,0,,This collar is pushed on with a hydraulic jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.76,0:15:38.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,套环受热后恢复原尺寸
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.76,0:15:38.72,Original,,0,0,0,,Reheating the collar makes it return to its normal size.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.32,0:15:44.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在将各部件和防漏接头装入活塞
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.32,0:15:44.64,Original,,0,0,0,,Now the different components and the leak-proof joints are inserted into the piston.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.64,0:15:48.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,减震器管装入活塞
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.64,0:15:48.96,Original,,0,0,0,,The shock absorber tube goes into the piston.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:53.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,这个部件在飞机着陆时吸收冲击应力
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.84,0:15:53.20,Original,,0,0,0,,This part absorbs the shock stresses when an aircraft lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.44,0:16:00.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,活塞现在滑入气缸，并确认减震器密封良好
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.44,0:16:00.08,Original,,0,0,0,,The piston is now slid into the cylinder and verified that the shock absorber is leak-proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.32,0:16:04.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,最后在烤箱中烘烤漆面，完成制造
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.32,0:16:04.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Fabrication finishes with paint baked in an oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.72,0:16:09.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,制造一套全新起落架需要6到8个月
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.72,0:16:09.60,Original,,0,0,0,,It takes 6 to 8 months to make new landing gear,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:13.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,而翻新一套二手的只需6到8周
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.00,0:16:13.12,Original,,0,0,0,,and between 6 to 8 weeks to recondition a used one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.36,0:16:24.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,香水、眼影、粉底、口红
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.36,0:16:24.80,Original,,0,0,0,,Perfume, eyeshadow, foundation, lipstick
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:28.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,这些都是由我们对美的追求所驱动的全球产业的产物
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.80,0:16:28.88,Original,,0,0,0,,they're all products of a global industry driven by our desire for beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.52,0:16:32.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,有些产品含有50多种成分
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.52,0:16:32.64,Original,,0,0,0,,But with over 50 ingredients going into some products,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.88,0:16:35.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,其中大部分都会涂抹在我们的身体上
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.88,0:16:35.52,Original,,0,0,0,,most of them destined to be slavered over our bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.92,0:16:38.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,因此这个行业必须以最高标准运作
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.92,0:16:38.56,Original,,0,0,0,,this industry needs to work to the highest of standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:48.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,化妆品自古以来就已存在
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.96,0:16:48.16,Original,,0,0,0,,Cosmetics have been in existence since the dawn of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:51.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,化妆品配方包含多种成分
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.88,0:16:51.60,Original,,0,0,0,,There are many ingredients that make up a cosmetic formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.48,0:16:57.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,该行业大量使用氧化铁，为产品调出多种色调
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.48,0:16:57.60,Original,,0,0,0,,The industry relies heavily on iron oxides to color its products in a multitude of tones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:04.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,进入生产之前，每种原料都必须精确称量
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.36,0:17:04.08,Original,,0,0,0,,Before moving into fabrication, each ingredient must be carefully and accurately weighed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:07.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,这些原料多为干性，比如粉末
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.88,0:17:07.84,Original,,0,0,0,,These raw materials are often dry, such as powder,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.32,0:17:10.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,但也可能是液体，甚至是油脂或蜡
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.32,0:17:10.88,Original,,0,0,0,,but can be also liquid, even oil or wax.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.84,0:17:15.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,每种成分都要先经过质量控制实验室的批准
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.84,0:17:15.84,Original,,0,0,0,,Every ingredient will have first been approved by the quality control laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.48,0:17:20.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,一个配方可能含有50多种成分
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.48,0:17:20.00,Original,,0,0,0,,A single formula may contain over 50 ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:28.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,另一种必不可少的成分是水
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.16,0:17:28.48,Original,,0,0,0,,The other essential ingredient is water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.44,0:17:34.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,制作化妆品的水先经过反渗透系统净化
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.44,0:17:34.80,Original,,0,0,0,,The water used in making cosmetics is first purified by an inverse osmosis system.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.28,0:17:39.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,根据配方的复杂程度
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.28,0:17:39.36,Original,,0,0,0,,Depending on the complexity of the recipe,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:42.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,生产一种产品需要4到10小时
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.68,0:17:42.96,Original,,0,0,0,,between 4 and 10 hours of work are needed to make up a product.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:54.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,以泡泡浴配方为例
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.80,0:17:54.16,Original,,0,0,0,,Take a bubble bath recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.96,0:18:00.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,配方的一部分在旁边的容器中配制，让某些成分更易溶解
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.96,0:18:00.00,Original,,0,0,0,,A part of the recipe is prepared in an adjoining container to make certain ingredients more soluble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:04.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,不锈钢螺旋桨搅拌器将所有成分充分混合
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.94,0:18:04.64,Original,,0,0,0,,A stainless steel screw propeller mixes all the ingredients thoroughly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:13.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,每一步，每种产品都要经过多项测试
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.84,0:18:13.76,Original,,0,0,0,,At each step, each product will be subjected to many tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.24,0:18:19.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,这里用颜色指示剂进行酸碱中和反应测试
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.24,0:18:19.04,Original,,0,0,0,,Here, an acid-base neutralization reaction test is performed with a color indicator.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.56,0:18:25.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,泡泡浴还需要上色
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.56,0:18:25.92,Original,,0,0,0,,The bubble bath has to be colored.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.58,0:18:28.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,加入香精和色素
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.58,0:18:28.32,Original,,0,0,0,,A fragrance and color are added.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.04,0:18:31.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,这样，最终成品会是淡紫色
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.04,0:18:31.92,Original,,0,0,0,,In this case, the final product will be mauve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.96,0:18:36.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,在灌装之前
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.96,0:18:36.44,Original,,0,0,0,,Before the filling process
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:42.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,质量控制实验室和微生物实验室会确保产品符合严格的质量标准
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.44,0:18:42.80,Original,,0,0,0,,the quality control and microbiology laboratories make sure that the product meets strict quality standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:45.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在进入下一道工序
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.22,0:18:45.44,Original,,0,0,0,,Now it's onto the next step.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.24,0:18:49.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台灌装机可同时灌装12瓶700毫升装
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.24,0:18:49.68,Original,,0,0,0,,This filler can simultaneously fill up to 12 700
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:52.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,以每分钟50瓶的稳定速度灌装
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.68,0:18:52.80,Original,,0,0,0,,milliliter bottles at a steady pace of 50 per minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:55.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,灌装量由电子设备调节
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.52,0:18:55.84,Original,,0,0,0,,The fill level is adjusted electronically.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.36,0:18:58.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,接下来是封盖
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.36,0:18:58.64,Original,,0,0,0,,Capping remains to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:03.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台封盖机自动定位并旋紧瓶盖
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.32,0:19:03.44,Original,,0,0,0,,This capper positions and tightens the caps automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.32,0:19:07.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,聚氨酯辊施加精确的旋紧力度
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.32,0:19:07.28,Original,,0,0,0,,Urethane rollers apply the precise tightening force.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.16,0:19:13.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,瓶子现在经过感应封口机
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.16,0:19:13.20,Original,,0,0,0,,The bottles now pass beneath the sealer via induction,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.20,0:19:14.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,它会产生磁场
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.20,0:19:14.88,Original,,0,0,0,,which generates a magnetic field,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.20,0:19:17.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,加热瓶盖内的金属片
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.20,0:19:17.36,Original,,0,0,0,,heating the metal piece placed in the cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.08,0:19:21.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,温度足够高时，金属片就熔合在瓶口上
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.08,0:19:21.12,Original,,0,0,0,,When hot enough, it welds itself onto the neck of the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.84,0:19:26.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,这里生产的另一种产品是撕拉面膜
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.84,0:19:26.48,Original,,0,0,0,,Another product made here is the peeling mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:28.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,面膜被倒入这个漏斗中
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.88,0:19:28.88,Original,,0,0,0,,The mask is poured into this funnel,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.36,0:19:31.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,漏斗末端连接着灌装管
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.36,0:19:31.84,Original,,0,0,0,,whose end is attached to the tube filler pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.40,0:19:34.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,产品依靠重力下落
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.40,0:19:34.48,Original,,0,0,0,,The product descends by gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.46,0:19:40.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,灌装机每分钟将撕拉面膜灌入50支软管
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.46,0:19:40.32,Original,,0,0,0,,The filler pours the peeling mask into 50 tubes each minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.92,0:19:48.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后通过加热和压边封口，软管封口后即可包装
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.92,0:19:48.48,Original,,0,0,0,,Then, with heat and crimping, the tube end is sealed and the tubes head for packaging.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.40,0:19:55.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,这里还生产古龙水和香水
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.40,0:19:55.76,Original,,0,0,0,,Other products made here: cologne and perfume water.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.56,0:19:58.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,液体通过抽吸被吸入瓶内
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.56,0:19:58.96,Original,,0,0,0,,The liquid is drawn into the bottle by suction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.56,0:20:07.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,瓶子被送至16个灌装喷头下方
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.56,0:20:07.76,Original,,0,0,0,,Bottles are positioned beneath the 16 filling spouts,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.76,0:20:12.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,喷头封住瓶口以形成真空，从而将产品吸入瓶内
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.76,0:20:12.80,Original,,0,0,0,,which seal their opening to allow for the creation of a vacuum, which draws in the product.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.80,0:20:16.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在插入喷雾泵
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.80,0:20:16.48,Original,,0,0,0,,Now, atomizer pumps are inserted,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.28,0:20:19.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,同时处理2个瓶子
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.28,0:20:19.28,Original,,0,0,0,,Handling 2 bottles simultaneously.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.60,0:20:22.98,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台机器封紧喷雾泵，将它固定在瓶口上
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.60,0:20:22.98,Original,,0,0,0,,This machine seals the pump, securing it around the neck of the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:28.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,白色套筒负责对准喷雾泵，灰色套筒则将其旋紧
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.76,0:20:28.48,Original,,0,0,0,,The white sleeve aligns the pump, while the grey one tightens them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.68,0:20:30.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,接下来是喷头
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.68,0:20:30.96,Original,,0,0,0,,Then there are the sprayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.52,0:20:33.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台机器装上喷头
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.52,0:20:33.60,Original,,0,0,0,,This machine applies the spray stoppers,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.76,0:20:37.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,并用锤子把它们压到瓶泵上，瓶子至此完成
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.76,0:20:37.84,Original,,0,0,0,,and with a hammer, presses them onto the pumps of the bottles, which are now finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.66,0:20:42.78,Translation,,0,0,0,,最后一种产品：走珠止汗露
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.66,0:20:42.78,Original,,0,0,0,,And one final product: roll-on deodorants.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:45.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台机器每分钟灌装115瓶
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.20,0:20:45.84,Original,,0,0,0,,This machine fills 115 bottles a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:47.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,一次处理8瓶
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.24,0:20:47.92,Original,,0,0,0,,handling 8 bottles at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.48,0:20:51.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,灌装管将产品注入瓶中
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.48,0:20:51.04,Original,,0,0,0,,A filling stem pours the product into the bottle,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:55.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,然后以每分钟115个的速度放入走珠
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.52,0:20:55.04,Original,,0,0,0,,and here they place the roller ball at 115 per minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.48,0:21:00.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后走珠被轻轻压入凹槽，在其中自由转动
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.48,0:21:00.24,Original,,0,0,0,,Then the ball is lightly pressed into the cavity, in which it turns freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:08.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,这家工厂每年生产1200多种产品，销量达3200万件
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.16,0:21:08.80,Original,,0,0,0,,This plant makes over 1,200 different products each year, and sells 32 million items.
